## Highlights
CdS QDs were encapsulated in zeolitic imidazolate framework-8 (ZIF-8) to form CdS@ZIF-8 muticore-shell nanoparticles.   
A sandwich-type electrochemical immunobiosensor was fabricated using CdS@ZIF-8 nanoparticles as signal-amplifying tags.   
The electrochemical signals were amplified greatly by using CdS@ZIF-8 nanoparticles as signal tags The detection limit for $E$ . coli O157:H7 detection is 3 CFU mL-1 (S/N=3).   
The immunobiosensor was successfully used to detect $E$ . coli O157:H7 in milk samples.
